    "highlights": "Typographic elements frequently use blur backdrops (.boxBlur) combined with animated hover opacities (opacity-50 to hover:opacity-100) and negative letter-spacing for tight, modern aesthetic lockups.",
    "insights": [
      "The typographic strategy centers on the custom Dinamo typeface family (ABCDiatype), projecting a modern, highly engineered, and technical brand identity.",
      "Tight negative letter-spacing (e.g., -0.04em or -0.64px) is consistently applied to display headings to create solid, monolithic text blocks.",
      "Extensive use of responsive relative line-heights (120%, 130%, 140%) ensures text scalability, while precise pixel values are strictly reserved for tightly controlled UI components like nav links and small labels."
